"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-07-19T15:34:59Z"},{"id":3035630714,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc608Ax6","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?u=25817fe797fcc7a812ba9d7f58f593f5a003abbb&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","login":"syntaxerror247","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108557#pullrequestreview-3035630714","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108557","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-07-20T00:33:36Z"},{"id":3035632210,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc608BJS","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?u=25817fe797fcc7a812ba9d7f58f593f5a003abbb&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","login":"syntaxerror247","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108557#pullrequestreview-3035632210","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108557","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-07-20T00:39:15Z"},{"id":3044007128,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc61b9zY","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?u=74caa4e396a8e2995ac648a80f7488601d679e63&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","login":"Alex2782","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782"},"body":"On Samsung Tab S7 Android 13 the bar remains black, last week the old version as in the video worked better.\r\n_(tested export template, Immersive mode = disabled, Edge To Edge = disabled)_\r\n\r\nHere some `Log.d` in the function `getWindowBackgroundColor`\r\n\r\n```java\r\n07-22 18:57:15.816  6974  6974 D Godot   : getWindowBackgroundColor\r\n07-22 18:57:15.816  6974  6974 D Godot   : background: android.graphics.drawable.GradientDrawable@c6a25f6\r\n07-22 18:57:15.816  6974  6974 D Godot   : is ColorDrawable: false\r\n07-22 18:57:15.816  6974  6974 D Godot   : typedValue.type: 3\r\n07-22 18:57:15.816  6974  6974 D Godot   : typedValue.data: 7592\r\n07-22 18:57:15.817  6974  6974 D Godot   : else null\r\n```\r\n\r\nwith PR #108287\r\n<img width=\"471\" height=\"100\" alt=\"Bildschirmfoto 2025-07-22 um 19 03 03\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c128778a-7f78-4eb4-a652-d5c76b0dae2a\" />\r\n\r\n","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108557#pullrequestreview-3044007128","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108557","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-07-22T17:01:03Z"},{"id":3044341256,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc61dPYI","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?u=74caa4e396a8e2995ac648a80f7488601d679e63&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","login":"Alex2782","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782"},"body":"We could also try evaluating `GradientDrawable`. The following code worked on Samsung Tab S7, but I'm not sure if it's all correct.\r\n\r\n<details><summary>background is GradientDrawable</summary>\r\n\r\n```kotlin\r\n\r\nimport android.graphics.drawable.GradientDrawable\r\n\r\nprivate fun getWindowBackgroundColor(activity: Activity): Int? {\r\n\tval background = activity.window.decorView.background\r\n\r\n\treturn when {\r\n\t\tbackground is ColorDrawable -> {\r\n\t\t\tbackground.color\r\n\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\tbackground is GradientDrawable -> {\r\n\t\t\tval solidColor = background.color?.defaultColor\r\n\t\t\tif (solidColor != null) {\r\n\t\t\t\treturn solidColor\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\t\tval gradientColors = background.colors\r\n\t\t\tif (gradientColors != null && gradientColors.isNotEmpty()) {\r\n\t\t\t\treturn gradientColors[0]\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\t\tnull\r\n\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\telse -> {\r\n\t\t\tval typedValue = TypedValue()\r\n\t\t\tval theme = activity.theme\r\n\r\n\t\t\ttheme.resolveAttribute(android.R.attr.windowBackground, typedValue, true)\r\n\r\n\t\t\treturn if (typedValue.type in TypedValue.TYPE_FIRST_COLOR_INT..TypedValue.TYPE_LAST_COLOR_INT) {\r\n\t\t\t\ttypedValue.data\r\n\t\t\t} else {\r\n\t\t\t\tnull\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t}\r\n}\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n\r\nEDIT:  I checked it, looks right to me\r\n\r\n```java\r\n07-23 00:06:04.258 16239 16239 D Godot   : getWindowBackgroundColor: -15263977\r\n07-23 00:06:04.259 16239 16239 D Godot   : bgColor HEX: #ff171717\r\n07-23 00:06:04.259 16239 16239 D Godot   : calculateLuminance: 0.008568125618069307\r\n```\r\n\r\n<img width=\"312\" height=\"155\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d8eb3be3-cd66-498f-bab3-9be79f4b6e84\" />\r\n","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108557#pullrequestreview-3044341256","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108557","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-07-22T18:30:24Z"},{"id":3064702271,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc62q6U_","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?u=74caa4e396a8e2995ac648a80f7488601d679e63&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","login":"Alex2782","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108557#pullrequestreview-3064702271","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108557","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-07-28T21:52:49Z"},{"id":3064766231,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc62rJ8X","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?u=74caa4e396a8e2995ac648a80f7488601d679e63&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","login":"Alex2782","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782"},"body":"It looks good to me, and I like the option to choose the background color. \r\n\r\n\r\n<details><summary>some notes (optional)</summary>\r\n\r\n--------\r\n\r\nHere, with the background color `#b0b0b0`, I would have expected the foreground color to be dark. But it's still recognizable enough.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<img width=\"324\" height=\"164\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/aa317901-db44-4386-b515-cd53b1b690cb\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPerhaps the following method would be more suitable, but this can be done in other PRs once we have more feedback from users:\r\n\r\n- https://www.w3.org/TR/WCAG21/#contrast-minimum\r\n- http://w3.org/TR/WCAG21/#dfn-contrast-ratio\r\n- https://www.siegemedia.com/contrast-ratio\r\n- https://accessible-colors.com/\r\n\r\n\r\n<details><summary>Kotlin code</summary>\r\n\r\n```kotlin\r\nfun getContrastRatio(foreground: Int, background: Int): Double {\r\n    fun getLuminance(color: Int): Double {\r\n        return ColorUtils.calculateLuminance(color)\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    val lum1 = getLuminance(foreground)\r\n    val lum2 = getLuminance(background)\r\n\r\n    val brighter = max(lum1, lum2)\r\n    val darker = min(lum1, lum2)\r\n\r\n    return (brighter + 0.05) / (darker + 0.05)\r\n}\r\n\r\n......\r\n\r\nval contrast = getContrastRatio(Color.WHITE, getWindowBackgroundColor(window))\r\n\r\nif (contrast < 4.5) {\r\n    // use dark foreground color \r\n}\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</detail>","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108557#pullrequestreview-3064766231","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108557","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-07-28T22:41:25Z"},{"id":3064819844,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc62rXCE","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?u=34072b401722100a7c0c0d61e37b376cf22b4545&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","login":"Repiteo","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo"},"body":"Whitespace needs trimming","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108557#pullrequestreview-3064819844","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pul